{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41349","headline":"过平戎谷吊胡翽 · 王仁裕","name":"过平戎谷吊胡翽","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"立马荒郊满目愁，伊人何罪死林丘。\n风号古木悲长在，雨湿寒莎泪暗流。\n莫道文章爲衆嫉，只应轻薄是身讐。\n不缘魂寄孤山下，此地堪名鹦鹉洲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王仁裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41349.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41349","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}